      "side": 1,
      "message": "can we go with LOG_TAG design and use TRACE_TAG? I assume the reason not is that we might have multiple types of traces?\n\nIf not and we need a servicemanager-specific macro: PERFETTO_TRACE_THIS_FUNCTION_WITH_ARG -\u003e PERFETO_SM_TRACE_FUNC maybe to make it clear that it\u0027s servicemanager-specific?",
